WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:14.405
Hopian: let’s get down from this mountain.

2
00:00:14.425 --> 00:00:17.667
Brad: I guess we could climb back down the vine.

3
00:00:22.229 --> 00:00:23.610
I think we should float down.

4
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.051
Tina: But how?

5
00:00:40.956 --> 00:00:49.002
Brad: Danny, that’s incredible!

6
00:00:49.022 --> 00:00:52.404
Danny: Imagination is a powerful thing!

7
00:00:52.425 --> 00:00:56.147
Hopian: Come on, Bello.

8
00:00:56.728 --> 00:00:57.668
It’s time to go.

9
00:01:03.884 --> 00:01:04.264
Bello: Balloon!

10
00:01:04.284 --> 00:01:06.606
Danny: Hopian, your land is very beautiful.

11
00:01:06.626 --> 00:01:10.009
Brad: It is so different from when we arrived.

12
00:01:10.029 --> 00:01:13.051
Brad: It looks like a completely different place.

13
00:01:13.071 --> 00:01:16.334
Hopian: It is completely different.

14
00:01:16.895 --> 00:01:18.216
It’s our home again.

15
00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:26.182
Hopian, your color is coming back!

16
00:01:26.983 --> 00:01:28.404
Hopian: It is?

17
00:01:29.365 --> 00:01:33.128
It has been so long since my fur was its true color.

18
00:01:33.792 --> 00:01:36.054
Hopian: I almost forgot how it looks.

19
00:01:36.875 --> 00:01:38.576
Tina: It looks good on you, Hopian!

20
00:01:38.936 --> 00:01:43.480
Hopian: Thank you, Tina.

21
00:01:44.281 --> 00:01:45.622
Thank you, all of you.

22
00:01:46.383 --> 00:01:48.384
Hopian: I hear something.

23
00:01:49.105 --> 00:01:51.287
There are others who want to thank you.

24
00:01:52.368 --> 00:01:54.990
Brad: I don’t hear anything.

25
00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:59.413
Hopian: Well, your ears are smaller than mine, aren’t they?

26
00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:07.120
Brad: Oh my gosh!

27
00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:09.061
Look at all the giants!

28
00:02:09.081 --> 00:02:12.222
Tina: Look at all the different colors they are!

29
00:02:12.242 --> 00:02:15.323
Danny: And look at how happy they are!

30
00:02:20.844 --> 00:02:21.504
My friends!

31
00:02:22.045 --> 00:02:26.866
This is Danny, and these are his friends, Tina and Brad.

32
00:02:26.886 --> 00:02:30.707
Hopian: They came from far away to help us.

33
00:02:31.967 --> 00:02:33.628
Our dark days are over.

34
00:02:35.052 --> 00:02:37.873
Hopian: They have defeated the evil Tristay!

35
00:02:42.294 --> 00:02:45.195
Hip-hip-hooray! Hip-hip-hooray!

36
00:02:45.215 --> 00:02:50.277
Tina: I think there is going to be a giant celebration!

37
00:02:50.297 --> 00:02:53.118
Hopian: I think you’re right, Tina.

38
00:03:07.152 --> 00:03:07.833
Giants: Hip-hip-hooray!

39
00:03:07.853 --> 00:03:08.733
Hip-hip-hooray! Tina: Whoo-hoo!

40
00:03:08.753 --> 00:03:09.093
This is fun!

41
00:03:09.113 --> 00:03:11.195
Brad: I wish they weren’t quite so excited!

42
00:03:11.215 --> 00:03:13.777
Danny: Wheeeeee!

43
00:03:15.898 --> 00:03:17.859
Tina: Who’s that?

44
00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.161
Brad: He looks important.

45
00:03:20.181 --> 00:03:24.964
Hopian: That is the governor of Ginormous.

46
00:03:24.984 --> 00:03:27.686
Hopian: I’m sure he wants to meet you.

47
00:03:28.547 --> 00:03:29.728
I’ll introduce you.

48
00:03:29.748 --> 00:03:35.652
Hopian: Governor, let me introduce Danny, Tina, and Brad.

49
00:03:37.372 --> 00:03:38.193
All three: Hello, Governor.

50
00:03:38.213 --> 00:03:42.276
Governor: It is a great honor to meet you.

51
00:03:42.736 --> 00:03:44.717
You saved Ginormous from Tristay.

52
00:03:44.737 --> 00:03:48.540
Governor: I declare tomorrow a day of celebration.

53
00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:52.263
Governor: We will hold a Ginormous feast for our heroes!

54
00:03:54.344 --> 00:03:57.346
Tina: Did the governor say a “Ginormous” feast?

55
00:03:57.366 --> 00:03:59.127
Danny: That’s what he said.

56
00:03:59.147 --> 00:04:02.310
Brad: I wonder what a Ginormous feast is like.

57
00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:05.212
Tina: I guess we’ll find out tomorrow.
